@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam defaultFontName -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif

participant "Client / CLI / UI" as Caller
participant "CascadeEngine" as Engine
participant "AppGrouper" as Grouper
participant "WindowLayoutGeometry" as Geometry

Caller -> Engine : calculateLayoutForWindows:orderMode:preferredOrder:...
activate Engine

Engine -> Grouper : partitionIntoAppGroups(windows)
activate Grouper
note right of Grouper
  1. Group windows by appName (case-insensitive)
  2. Order windows within each group:
     - MRU/Custom/Fractal: zRank ascending
     - Spatial: origin.x ascending
     - Alpha: title ascending
end note
Grouper --> Engine : map of [appName -> [CascadeWindow]]
deactivate Grouper

Engine -> Engine : calculateAppGroupKeys(mode, groups)
note right of Engine
  Representative Key K_app per group:
  - MRU: min(zRank) across windows
  - Spatial: min(origin.x) across windows
  - Alphabetical: appName
  - Custom: rankForApp (tie-break min(zRank))
  - Fractal: rankForApp or initial appearance
end note

Engine -> Engine : sortGroupsAndFlatten(groups, keys)
note right of Engine
  Concatenate sorted groups:
  Contiguity Invariant guaranteed!
  Windows of same app are strictly adjacent.
end note

Engine -> Geometry : assignFramesToOrderedWindows:onUsableFrame:...
activate Geometry
Geometry --> Engine : planned frames assigned
deactivate Geometry

Engine --> Caller : ordered windows with target frames
deactivate Engine

@enduml
